{"data":[{"author_id":"2609353712","created_at":"2026-10-18T17:22:16.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2111870491292324273"],"id":"2111870491292324273","in_reply_to_user_id":"1023150691030728704","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":0,"impression_count":47,"like_count":0,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":1,"retweet_count":0},"referenced_tweets":[{"id":"2111865784096174157","type":"replied_to"}],"text":"@an1sh123 Gotokaler drissho.\n\nBhir valoi chilo. Shoru rasta bole dhukte ektu oshubidha hoyechilo, ar khub e baaje crowd management chilo. But ha harmless. \n\nAr ekta advice, agge Sikdar Bagan dekha ta bekar, onekta ghurte hobe. Agge Nabin Pally dekhar por Sikdar Bagan e dhuko.","url":"https://x.com/alostsouldown/status/2111870491292324273"},{"author_id":"1674681718895411201","created_at":"2026-10-18T06:32:53.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2111707069191729395"],"id":"2111707069191729395","in_reply_to_user_id":"3236685834","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":0,"impression_count":84,"like_count":0,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":0,"retweet_count":0},"referenced_tweets":[{"id":"2111671635707314677","type":"replied_to"}],"text":"@goonereol I haven’t been there in recent times but I was turned away from Kashi Bose lane the year before on tritiya. Majority pandals have always opened from choturthi panchami only. Last year on choturthi there was still work going on in sikdar Bagan and nabinpally didn’t allow us in.","url":"https://x.com/reindeerdodo89/status/2111707069191729395"},{"attachments":{"media_keys":["3_2111560942781906944","3_2111560942828040193","3_2111560942777716736","3_2111560942781931520"]},"author_id":"1523593545021411328","created_at":"2026-10-17T20:52:21.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2111560972871856630"],"id":"2111560972871856630","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":0,"impression_count":35,"like_count":1,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":0,"retweet_count":0},"text":"Safety disaster at Ganendra Mitra Lane (700004)! Couldn’t even walk to my own doorstep today. Crowd feels like a mob due to illegal stalls &amp; pathetic management by Nabin Pally, Sikdar Bagan, Nalin Sarkar St &amp; North Tridhara.\n\nPlease help @KolkataPolice @paulagnimitra1 @SuvenduWB https://t.co/DAYZgEbo6J","url":"https://x.com/ubot_777/status/2111560972871856630"},{"attachments":{"media_keys":["3_2111338773644824576"]},"author_id":"2051233923833757696","created_at":"2026-10-17T06:09:27.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2111338785564979685"],"id":"2111338785564979685","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":0,"impression_count":16,"like_count":0,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":0,"retweet_count":0},"text":"Durga Puja 2026 : Chief Minister Dr. Manik Saha Inaugurates Durga Puja Pandal Organized By Forward Club.\n#Durga #Puja #Chief #Minister #Dr #Manik #Saha  #CM #Inaugurates #Forward #Club #Agartala #Tripura \nhttps://t.co/oGLF1kdn00 https://t.co/rM8gxmJUEa","url":"https://x.com/NewsStar69313/status/2111338785564979685"},{"attachments":{"media_keys":["3_2111304768295665664","3_2111304797228048384","3_2111304825728327680","3_2111304852366315521"]},"author_id":"37407255","created_at":"2026-10-17T03:54:43.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2111304876550762887"],"id":"2111304876550762887","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":2,"impression_count":534,"like_count":22,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":1,"retweet_count":2},"text":"Did some more pandal hopping yesterday \n\nPally Mangal Samity (EEDF ground) https://t.co/IxpQsaLwtd","url":"https://x.com/Aagan86/status/2111304876550762887"},{"attachments":{"media_keys":["3_2110671891602210816","3_2110671918626201600","3_2110671950020542464","3_2110671973227577344"]},"author_id":"1023150691030728704","created_at":"2026-10-15T09:59:51.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2110671990084493596"],"id":"2110671990084493596","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":1,"impression_count":453,"like_count":39,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":1,"retweet_count":3},"text":"#3 Visited Taltala Pally Mangal Samiti. Good pandal. https://t.co/jxxqoOVi6w","url":"https://x.com/an1sh123/status/2110671990084493596"},{"author_id":"3868003454","created_at":"2026-10-13T07:43:17.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2109912846398271869"],"id":"2109912846398271869","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":63,"impression_count":4705,"like_count":108,"quote_count":1,"reply_count":5,"retweet_count":11},"referenced_tweets":[{"id":"2109684043096965608","type":"quoted"}],"text":"So there are some 3000 pandals in the city. Covering all of them won't be possible or practical. If you want to do just the big and famous one, even that would be some 200 pandals and on Ashtami/Navami visiting just one of them can eat up 5-6 hours. \n\nSo this needs planning. https://t.co/KYHxFmIMLJ","url":"https://x.com/EducatedMoron/status/2109912846398271869"},{"attachments":{"media_keys":["3_2109527758665854976","3_2109527771450134528"]},"author_id":"2084548793731895296","created_at":"2026-10-12T06:13:13.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2109527792610374058"],"id":"2109527792610374058","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":6,"impression_count":3925,"like_count":110,"quote_count":2,"reply_count":4,"retweet_count":3},"text":"Visited the 23 Palli Durga Temple in Harish Mukherjee Road, Kolkata. This beautiful temple where I go every year on the day of Mahalaya is directly opposite to Shantiniketan the house of TMC politician Abhishek Banerjee. https://t.co/gT7b3EOQPc","url":"https://x.com/AhanaGhosh27197/status/2109527792610374058"}],"includes":{"media":[{"height":2048,"media_key":"3_2111560942781906944","type":"photo","url":"https://pbs.twimg.com/media/HU3FfWwawAAyJnj.jpg","width":1536},{"height":2048,"media_key":"3_2111560942828040193","type":"photo","url":"https://pbs.twimg.com/media/HU3FfW7asAE5gHT.jpg","width":1536},{"height":2048,"media_key":"3_2111560942777716736","type":"photo","url":"https://pbs.twimg.com/media/HU3FfWva0AA7PPn.jpg","width":1536},{"height":2048,"media_key":"3_2111560942781931520","type":"photo","url":"https://pbs.twimg.com/media/HU3FfWwbIAAlojU.jpg","width":